        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The share of a draw&apos;s texels that must carry :cpp:member:`flags` for the draw to be picked, eg.
``0.01`` for a draw that holds any real amount of the flagged material among others.
**Default**: ``0.5``, more than half
</verbatim> </para>
